{"id":"agujero","lemma":"agujero","pos":"noun","rank":1224,"glosses":["hole (hollow place or cavity)","pincushion (device that holds sewing pins)","unjustified imbalance, debt"],"ipa":"/aɡuˈxeɾo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"agujeros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-agujero.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él cavó un agujero.","en":"He dug a hole.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440100"},{"text":"¿Existen los agujeros negros?","en":"Do black holes exist?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800997"},{"text":"Cava un agujero profundo.","en":"Dig a deep hole.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707231"},{"text":"Hay agujeros en el tejado.","en":"There are holes in the roof.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642112"},{"text":"Ellos cavan un agujero.","en":"They're digging a hole.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461405"}]}